# Her memory database, and whatever she has been told.
data/

# The profile folder is written on first run from src/core/profile/defaults.ts
# and is yours to edit from then on. It is not checked in, because a character
# sheet that ships as both source and as generated output drifts apart within a
# week and the copy the model reads is never the copy you edited.
#
# It also holds a photograph of somebody. Both names are listed: `anna-profile`
# is what this folder was called before the project was renamed to Hers, and an
# install from before the rename keeps using it. Dropping the old line would
# quietly start offering a real person's face to `git add`.
hers-profile/
anna-profile/
